# OKE3D — Non-negotiable

## Identity

Build a premium cinematic collectible experience for **oke3d.nl**, not a generic AI landing page or SaaS template.

Feel: collectible culture + 3D craft + digital art + premium product.  
Not: crypto / gaming / AI startup / kids toy store.

## Visual

- Dark charcoal / near-black + off-white
- Electric blue = **accent only** (filament, edge, type, micro UI) — never default full-page blue wash
- Typography is a primary design material (editorial display + clean body)
- Asymmetry, negative space, edge-to-edge allowed; avoid default card grids

## Forbidden default hero pattern

Black background + blue gradient blob + big white headline + glowing CTA + floating spinning object + fade-in-up on everything + glassmorphism + random particles.

## Motion

- GSAP + ScrollTrigger; follow official GSAP skills + `.cursor/skills/oke3d-motion-design`
- Primary / secondary / ambient hierarchy
- No infinite product spin
- No animation checklist fade-ins
- `matchMedia` for mobile vs desktop
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Stack

Vite + React + TS + Cloudflare Workers. No Tailwind/tsparticles/R3F unless explicitly approved. Quality over speed; hero acceptance criteria must pass Browser QA before calling hero done.

## Skills

Apply project skills: `oke3d-creative-direction`, `oke3d-motion-design`, `oke3d-frontend-quality`.
